  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPC Pacific Statistics and Data 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity responds to the issues of quantity, quality, availability, accessibility, and usability of data for evidence-informed decision making across the Pacific and in MFAT&apos;s Pacific and Development Group (PDG). It funds The Pacific Community&apos;s (SPC) Statistics for Development Division and the Pacific Data Hub to improve capability, governance, publication, dissemination, accessibility, and use of Pacific data, statistics, research and evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
